  "question": {
    "text": "If the term independent of $x$ in the expansion of $\\left(\\sqrt{\\mathrm{a}} x^2+\\frac{1}{2 x^3}\\right)^{10}$ is 105 , then $\\mathrm{a}^2$ is equal to :",
